  "metadata": {
    "title": "Wikidata removed statements from Oct 2014 - Jan 2021",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.4686805",
    "publication_date": "2021-04-14",
    "description": "<p>This dataset contains 76.5M statements&nbsp; that have been permanently removed (i.e., removed from a Wikidata dump and not added again) since the first available dump of Wikidata in October, 2014.</p>\n\n<p>The dataset was generated by downloading all available weekly JSON Wikidata dumps from the Internet Archive; converting them to the KGTK format; and extracting only those statements that had been removed between each pair of dumps (i.e., calculating the deltas).</p>\n\n<p>The dataset is in KGTK format (https://kgtk.readthedocs.io/en/latest/specification/), a tsv file</p>",
